---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /menu/
title: "Menus: All-You-Can-Eat KBBQ & Drinks"
description: Do Si Korean BBQ menus for Alki Beach (West Seattle) and Kent, WA. All-you-can-eat in Signature, Premium and Supreme tiers, KBBQ combos, Korean appetizers, stews, soju and cocktails.
breadcrumbs: [{ name: "Menus", url: "/menu/" }]
---
{%- set A = menus.ayce -%}
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>Menus</span></nav>
    
    <h1 class="display h1"><span class="serif">Our</span> Menus</h1>
    <p class="lede">Each Do Si has its own menu and prices. Pick yours for all-you-can-eat, combos, Korean classics and drinks.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section section--tight" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap menu-hub">
    {% for loc in locations %}
    <div class="menu-hub__item reveal{% if loop.index == 2 %} reveal-d1{% endif %}">
    <a href="{{ loc.menuPage }}">
      {% set hubImg = "kbbq-spread" if loc.key == 'alki' else "kbbq-spread-2" %}{% img hubImg, "", { sizes: "(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 50vw" } %}
      <div class="menu-hub__label">
        <p class="eyebrow">{{ loc.neighborhood }}</p>
        <h2>{{ loc.name }} menu</h2>
        <div class="chips"><span class="chip chip--gold">AYCE from {{ A[loc.key].signature }}</span>{% if loc.key == 'alki' %}<span class="chip">Happy hour</span>{% else %}<span class="chip">Bento &amp; lunch specials</span>{% endif %}</div>
      </div>
    </a>
    <div class="menu-hub__actions">
      <a class="btn btn--red" href="{{ loc.menuPage }}">View {{ loc.name }} menu</a>
      {% if loc.orderUrl %}<a class="btn btn--light" href="{{ loc.orderUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Order pickup</a>{% endif %}
    </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
